{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10165","headline":"送袁员外宣慰劝农毕赴洪州使院 · 李嘉佑","name":"送袁员外宣慰劝农毕赴洪州使院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣主临前殿，殷忧遣使臣。\n气迎天诏喜，恩发土膏春。\n草色催归櫂，莺声爲送人。\n龙沙多道里，流水自相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}